course: dictionary
lesson: 2902
title: Many meanings of one word
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One small word can have many meanings. Down is a good example. To find which meaning is right, look at the words around it. «The internet is down» means not working, because the word down is describing the internet, not a place or a direction.
explain: Some words are part of a phrase. «Lily calms Maddie down, and Maddie makes Lily laugh.» Here calms down means makes someone calmer. The two words belong together, so you understand them as one idea.
explain: Use the swap check. Put your meaning in place of the word and read it again. «The gull swoops down and snatches one» works with toward a lower place: the gull flies toward the ground and grabs the chip. If the sentence makes no sense, try a different meaning.
fact: Down can mean toward a lower place: «swoops down» means flies toward the ground.
fact: Down can mean less or lower in amount, as in «prices going down».
fact: Feeling down means feeling sad.
fact: Down is the soft, fluffy feathers of young birds, and downs are hills.
fact: «Write down» means put on paper, and «the internet is down» means it is not working.
exercise: «The internet is down.» What does down mean here? | Lying on the floor | Very happy | *Not working | Lower in amount
exercise: Prices are going down this week. What does down mean? | *Becoming lower in amount | Being very sad | Going up a hill | Soft feathers
exercise: «The gull swoops down and snatches one.» Which meaning fits best? | Feeling sad | Written on paper | Along a road | *Toward a lower place
test: «Please slow down near the school.» What does slow down mean? | Feel sad | Fall off | Write it down | *Go more slowly
test: Ravi says, «I am feeling down today.» What does he mean? | Feeling hungry | Feeling tall | *Feeling sad | Feeling cold
exam: «The temperature declines by 3 degrees.» Which word means the same as declines? | Jumps | Grows | *Decreases | Shines
